.TH BASHMENU 1 "2026-09-13" "v0.0.1" "HA Bash Menu Manual"
.SH NAME
bashmenu \- lightweight curses TUI menu engine and settings manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bashmenu.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bashmenu
is a data-driven, Curses-based Text User Interface (TUI) menu engine designed
for Linux system administration, settings management, and command execution. It
reads its menu structure from a YAML-formatted menu file, dynamically
interpolates configurations and system environment variables, and supports
custom Nerd Fonts, visual file chooser dialogs, and modular code templates.
.SH COMPONENT FILES
.TP
.I bashmenu.sh
Launcher wrapper script. Handles Python virtual environment setup and repairs.
.TP
.I bashmenu.py
Core Python application containing the Curses renderer and main menu loop.
.TP
.I bashedit.py
Built-in Nano-style text editor engine.
.TP
.I menuedit.py
Interactive TUI menu tree editor for managing bashmenu.mnu.
.TP
.I bashmenu.yml
Settings configuration database in YAML format.
.TP
.I bashmenu.mnu
Menu layout structure definitions list in YAML format.
.TP
.I bashmenu.themes
Color theme definitions (supporting 256, 16, and 8 color modes).
.TP
.I ymlcheck.py
Command line utility to validate YAML syntax and schemas.
.SH MAN PAGES (MANUALS)
The application provides a local man page for terminal-based help:
.TP
.I bashmenu.1
Exhaustive terminal manual page for HA Bash Menu.
