Navigate highlighted selection row.
.TP
.B 0-9, a-z, A-Z
Select menu option directly by shortcut hotkey.
.TP
.B F1
Display the markdown help manual using the glow terminal pager.
.TP
.B F4
Launch menuedit.py visual menu tree editor.
.TP
