Toggle visibility of option shortcut key badges.
.TP
.B ENTER
Execute active selected menu option action.
.TP
.B ESC
Return to parent menu, or quit if at the root menu level.

.PP
.B Intelligent State Retention:
When returning from editors, or scripts with refresh: true, the engine traces and preserves your submenu coordinate depth to return you to your exact location, skipping the root menu.
